WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<i>[Playful music]</i>
A hungry llama reaches for a snack—and slips right down on the ice!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A little bird hops down beside him on the frozen trail.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:36.500
Out on the snowy train tracks, the little bird stands watch.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:49.500
<i>[Train rumbling close]</i>
Startled by an oncoming train, the llama locks eyes on a plump red berry!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Snatch! Each time the llama leans in, the cheeky bird nabs the berry first.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>[Clattering rails]</i>
Side by side in a wooden mine cart, they rattle through a dark tunnel!

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:23.300
Holding tight to the berry, they shoot out of the tunnel into open sky!

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:34.000
<i>[Whooshing wind]</i>
Wide-eyed and spinning, the llama sails high above snowy mountain peaks!

00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:43.500
Paws waving wildly, he tumbles through the crisp mountain air.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:58.500
<i>[Quiet twilight music]</i>
Alone in the hush of twilight, a small traveler wanders to a cliff above the sea.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.500
Beneath a blanket of stars, faint sparkles drift around the quiet llama.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:13.500
<i>[Warm, hopeful melody]</i>
The little bird slips back up—bringing a whole bunch of red berries!

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:22.800
Soon a whole crowd of friends appears behind him, ready to share the feast.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:29.800
